  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <h3>Is cloud computing suitable for beginners?</h3>
  <p>
    Yes. Beginners can start with computer fundamentals,
    networking, Linux and introductory cloud services.
  </p>

  <h3>Do I need programming skills for cloud computing?</h3>
  <p>
    Basic scripting with Python or PowerShell is useful for
    automation. The requirements depend on the role.
  </p>

  <h3>Can I learn cloud computing after graduation?</h3>
  <p>
    Yes. Graduates can study cloud fundamentals, practise
    projects and pursue relevant certifications.
  </p>

